OL,3,A'Add me to WhatsApp' scam calls to be
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's data watchdog is investigating
OL,7,Fa spike in complaints about "robo
OL,8,Fcalls" - where a recorded voice asks
OL,9,Fyou to add them on WhatsApp - that are
OL,10,Fsuspected to lead to a recruitment
OL,11,Fscam.
OL,13,FThe Information Commission's Office
OL,14,F(ICO) had more than 3,600 complaints
OL,15,Fabout automated calls in September - a
OL,16,Ffive-year high and nearly three times
OL,17,Fthe number it had in July.
OL,19,FBut it suspects millions of people are
OL,20,Fgetting these calls and told BBC Radio
OL,21,F4's You and Yours it was "deeply
OL,22,Fconcerned" by the sharp rise.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
