OL,3,A'Add me to WhatsApp' scam calls to be
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ICO advises people to ignore calls
OL,7,Ffrom numbers they don't recognise, and
OL,8,Fto block and report any suspicious
OL,9,Fcalls to the watchdog.
